    {
      "id": 2,
      "revisions": [
        {
          "created_at": "2026-09-30T16:13:00+00:00",
          "block": "Title: OpenAI DevDay Expands Agents, Cloud Coding, and Collaboration\nURL: https://runtimewire.com/article/everything-openai-announced-at-the-devday-2026-keynote\nImage URL: https://runtimewire.com/og/everything-openai-announced-at-the-devday-2026-keynote.16x9.jpg?v=og2-16f559n\nSummary: OpenAI unveiled Dots, ChatGPT Space, GPT-6.1 Sol, Astra Ultrafast, and a $500 Pro tier with 25× Plus usage. Codex gained reusable cloud environments and a redesigned CLI; local execution remains supported. Dots also serves business and enterprise plans, not just Pro. Decisions API enters limited preview, while Agents API remains in public beta with new computer-use capabilities.",
          "sha256": "bc786399e56b6c538ce2c5a1add50470676ecf893ec2d9bd81b4f3439585fecd",
          "source": "Runtimewire",
          "request_id": "seed_bc786399e56b6c538ce2c5a1add50470676ecf893ec2d9bd81b4f3439585fecd",
