          "created_at": "2026-09-30T21:37:02.552852+00:00",
          "block": "Title: OpenAI Introduces Shareable ChatGPT Profiles for Sites and Plugins\nURL: https://techbytes.app/posts/chatgpt-shareable-profiles-sites-connected-plugins/\nImage URL: https://images.ctfassets.net/kftzwdyauwt9/aB63r2gBV8LU2iVdqe8gi/fb99275504cecc014ddcad1c98cbbc17/SHAREABLE_PROFILES_PMM_Deanna_.png?w=1920&q=90&fm=webp\nSummary: OpenAI is rolling out shareable ChatGPT profiles that bring Sites and plugins together for discovery and reuse. Shared skills remain within workspaces. The feature is available to Free, Go, Plus, Pro, and Business users on web and desktop, with Enterprise support coming soon.",
