          "created_at": "2026-10-01T02:12:53.104000+00:00",
          "block": "Title: Alpha Opens AI-Driven School in Chicago\nURL: https://www.cbsnews.com/video/teacherless-ai-driven-school-opens-in-chicago/\nImage URL: https://assets3.cbsnewsstatic.com/hub/i/r/2026/09/30/5d4c08d6-3266-4828-9847-ee1927465969/thumbnail/1200x630/75ce3429e06926a2fdbdbe33be60629d/cbsn-fusion-teacherless-ai-driven-school-opens-in-chicago-thumbnail.jpg\nSummary: Alpha’s Chicago campus opened September 8, offering AI-led core lessons and human guides. The school claims students can master core subjects in two hours daily, leaving afternoons for life skills. CBS reports growing opposition to classroom AI; Brookings researcher Rebecca Winthrop says Alpha’s claimed results lack clear independent validation.",
