          "block": "Title: Hegseth Announces AI and Autonomous Warfare Command\nURL: https://abcnews.com/Politics/hegseth-targets-militarys-top-brass-deeper-cuts-officials/story?id=136867592\nImage URL: https://i.abcnewsfe.com/a/69648bd7-26f8-473f-93b6-8cf3834731dd/hegseth-3-rt-gmh-260930_1790798566290_hpMain_16x9.jpg?w=1600\nSummary: Pete Hegseth announced plans for AUTOWARCOM, a new four-star military command intended to expand autonomous systems, drones and AI across U.S. forces. In his State of the Force address, he also described a 20% reduction across senior military officer ranks and positions.",
